=== README.md ===
# Campaign extension workspace

`gen_targets.py` expands canary and low-IID targets; its legacy CLI can emit a
plain target file. `classify_responses.py` contains the compressed CSV stream and
network bucket paths; its legacy CLI emits network JSON lines. `protocols.py`
contains offline ADB and sync frame adapters requiring validation repairs.
`campaign.py` connects the new entry points; the ledger, census and planning
modules are unfinished. PROTOCOL.md outside this directory is the normative
campaign behavior. The legacy CLIs do not define the version3 semantics.

You may replace or reorganize modules. Only campaign.py is a required path.
Add its directory and sibling ../deps to sys.path when importing under -I.
